{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CftKTJiFk8hczwaH42niP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Yes, build it. Don't hold it for interviews.**\n\n**Why:**\n- **The need is clear.** Customers are asking for a specific thing (a CSV of invoices for their accountant) and doing it by hand without one. 29 of about 900 accounts (~3%) asked in one quarter, and people who copy rows by hand usually don't file tickets, so the real number is probably higher.\n- **It pays back fast.** Three support hours a week is about 150 hours a year, against two days to build. It pays for itself in about a month, before counting customer time or goodwill.\n- **It's cheap and reversible.** It reuses the existing table component and ships behind a flag, so being wrong costs little. Five interviews would take as long as building it.\n\n**What to do next:**\n1. **Use the support query as the spec.** Support has already emailed this file many times. Its columns and format are a tested starting point, and replies in those 41 tickets show what accountants accepted.\n2. **Check the scope quickly.** Will export follow the current filters and date range? Does it include line items or only invoice totals? Does it need dates and currency formatted for QuickBooks or Xero import? Ask these in a short async note to a few of the 29 accounts, not a five-interview study.\n3. **Release to the 29 accounts first.** Let support point new requests to the feature. Then turn it on for everyone.\n4. **Measure** how many accounts export, how often, and whether export tickets and support hours drop toward zero within about 4 weeks.\n5. **Talk to people later, and target it.** Interview active exporters about what their accountant does next. That will show whether to go further, such as scheduled exports or direct accounting integrations. It's a better use of the PM's interviews than confirming a need the tickets already show."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3190,"cache_read_input_tokens":5043,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3190},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"16e7c70a-ac66-41cd-bc13-e23e2a650d95","uuid":"621c4725-6562-4bd3-9dee-f1f77bb96b80","timestamp":"2026-10-10T09:27:53.282Z","request_id":"req_011CftKTJUc1ujdUbYwUUA8W"}
